{"id":"woher","lemma":"woher","pos":"adv","rank":300,"glosses":["where from, whence","how (not the general meaning of \"in which way\", but meaning \"from which source\" or \"from where\" exactly)"],"ipa":"/voˈheːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/De-woher.ogg/De-woher.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Woher kennen Sie ihn?","en":"Where do you know him from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/565929","words":[null,{"g":"to know"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"him"}]},{"text":"Woher kommen Träume?","en":"Where do dreams come from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566045","words":[null,{"g":"to come"},{"g":"dreams"}]},{"text":"Woher kommt ihr?","en":"Where are you from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/711776","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"}]},{"text":"Ich weiß nicht, woher er kommt.","en":"I don't know where he comes from.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566847","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Ich wusste nicht, woher es kam.","en":"I didn't know where it came from.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]}]}